Here are some character "classes" I think would be nice for future Nethacks
(or nh--:ses)...

	D - Dwarf (there was a lot of discussion about this one and I
	    fully second the motion. We have elves, why not dwarfs?)

	I - Investigator: actually would have wanted a "detective", but I guess
	    the D is reserved for Dwarf. Intrinsics should include at least
	    stealth and automatic searching. I pretty often want to play
	    characters like "Sherlock" and have to pick A since it is the 
	    closest one can get. Investigator deities, you ask? Oh... 
	
	J - Jester! Someone suggested this one for Moria, but I think it would
	    suit the Nethack atmosphere better. Jesters have often been one
